{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99958","id":2212633527,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6D4hu3","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99958","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99958.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99958.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99958","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99958/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99958/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99958/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/05010180ce269246bb408525dcda8945d393ea7c","number":99958,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add Blend Distance property to ReflectionProbe","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Supersedes #61416\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the \"Blend Distance\" property to reflection probes. This parameter is exposed to offer artists control over how quickly a reflection probe blends into the scene.\r\nSome context on why this property is necessary: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/61416#issuecomment-2504900574\r\n\r\nThis PR builds on @Calinou's initial work, however I've entirely reworked how the blend parameter is calculated and smoothed.\r\nThis is for two reasons:\r\n- The blend is now calculated for each axis of the probe separately. This is necessary to keep an even blend-distance on each side of the probe bounds. In other words, this avoids the blending being warped based on the proportions of the AABB.\r\n- The blend smoothing before had an issue where it would strangely reduce the strength inside the probe.\r\n\r\nBlend Distance is a float representing the length of the blend in meters, with a default range of 0 to 8, or greater.\r\n\r\nI've added an interior wireframe to display the extends of the blend-distance within the AABB of the main probe. This makes it clear at what point the blending stops, and where the probe emits \"full strength\". (For the sake of presentation, I commented out the lines between the corners and center_offset for this GIF, this would be the case if #99920 gets merged)\r\n\r\n![24_12_03_12_54__godot windows editor x86_64_b89yussjEj](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82bc5533-65d4-4d41-bd86-70d31dc7d23d)\r\n\r\nWall test scene, replication of the example scenario I gave in the context comment:\r\n![24_12_03_01_36__godot windows editor x86_64_w4N2WPk8jF](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9bc15375-144f-435f-8c4f-7cfaaaa6b691)\r\n\r\nComparison of the same scene to 4.3:\r\n| 4.3 - unadjusted probes | 4.3 - adjusted probes | This PR |\r\n| -- | -- | -- |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee389fa1-202d-479d-ae11-98d8f2da4ddb) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/928ffee5-e062-4777-9554-d3f14eb80358) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e83bf177-5630-49d9-84be-3ebc96f8b0a4) |\r\n\r\nUnadjusted probes have the same bounds as in the PR.\r\nAdjusted probes have enlarged bounds, which is why the wall in the adjusted probes get stronger reflections. However, since this needs to happen on both sides of the wall to accommodate for the view from that side, you get bleeding.\r\nNotice how despite that adjustment and being well within the bounds of the probe, the wall is still significantly darker due to not receiving full reflection strength.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.githu